{
  "slug": "pownie",
  "name": "Pownie",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The agent harness for offsec. It's a plugin for Claude Code packed with skills, hooks, memory system that works best for using Claude Code to achieve ai pentest/ctf",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `offsec-debrief` (Post-challenge debrief — generates writeup with structured failure analysis), `offsec-intel-graph` (Neo4j graph database for offensive security intel), `offsec-lead` (Orchestrator agent for iterative-deepening multi-agent coordination), `strategy-compact` (Suggests manual context compaction at logical intervals to preserve context through task phases rather than arbitrary auto-compaction)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pownie@claude-community` from `d0gesec/pownie`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
